                                "sense_id": "a581f8c1-9d88-38eb-aa17-cbb6ea703754",
                                "text": "Latein war die Kultursprache des europäischen Mittelalters.",
                                "translation": "Latin was the language of civilisation of the European Middle Ages.",
                                "english": "Latin was the language of civilisation of the European Middle Ages."
                            },
                            {
